== About this portal ==
This portal is a reader-facing navigation view over a coherent knowledge surface. It does not create an ontology class, Entity type, or Domain merely by existing.

Parent/child portal relationships are navigational. A subportal may cross multiple domains when that is the clearest way to traverse the corpus.

See [[BITwiki:Navigation]], [[BITwiki:Organization]], and [[BITwiki:Semantic properties]].

